            - \"Value\" (string)
    - \"Detailed Instructions\": an object with:
        - \"Action\" (string)
        - \"Field\" (string)
        - \"Value\" (string)

Wrap only the JSON array in triple backticks using the format:
```json
[ ... ]
```

Do not include any preamble, titles, or explanation outside the required two parts. Only output the critique followed by the JSON array.
"""

